        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu nimusiimwa ki, ku muraabe nimuteerwa ahabw'okukora kubi mukagumisiriza? Kwonka ku murikukora gye, mwabonabonesibwa, mukagumisiriza, ekyo nikyo kirikusiimwa ahari Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.2.20",
